<b>SAML SIGNING CERTIFICATE EXPIRES IN 7 DAYS — EMERGENCY METADATA ATTACHED.</b>
The IdentiCore IdP signing certificate for your tenant (<b>tenant acme.identicore.example</b>)
expires <b>July 21</b>. After expiry, every SAML assertion fails validation — <b>all SSO logins
across your 14 SAML apps fail simultaneously</b> (no way to log in to fix remotely; recovery is
the emergency local-admin procedure). The <b>emergency metadata package is attached</b>
(identicore-metadata-2027.xml) — import it into your SPs (or your federation proxy) before
July 21, exactly as with the 2025 rotation.
</p>

<h3>1. Rotation Details</h3>
