<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Rotation cadence</td><td>Every 2 years (last: July 2025)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Import deadline</td><td><b>Before July 21</b> (expiry is hard)</td></tr>
